      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for saying that. but i dont have any other symptoms like a headache or anything, just the face thing. my chin is also kind of twitching on that side. honestly i really dont want to sit in an ER for 8 hours if i can help it. do you think it's definitely just bells palsy? it seems pretty common right?",
