      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what you're saying but i really think it's just bell's palsy. i looked it up and the twitching and the eye thing are classic. honestly i'm just looking for some reassurance so i can sleep this off and see how i feel in the morning. if i just take some high dose vitamin b or maybe some steroids like i read online, do you think that would help clear it up by tomorrow? i'd rather do that than go to the hospital right now.",
